00:02:02.110 --> 00:02:03.070
Here!

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:11.080
Nayuki, it's not visiting hours right now.

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:12.910
I know.

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:17.370
There's no need to worry about me, so go to school.

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:20.000
Today is the graduation ceremony so...

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:23.130
Oh, it's already the season for that...

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:28.550
Are you doing well with Yuuichi-san?

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:31.010
Yeah, we're doing alright.

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:32.170
I see.

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:36.890
A month has passed since Ayu disappeared in front of me.

00:02:37.430 --> 00:02:41.940
Akiko-san, who was involved in an accident, has recovered enough to start rehabilitation.

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:43.980
But...

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:45.320
Nayuki
I'm going to the hospital

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:49.610
Since that day, Nayuki and I continued to subtly avoid each other...
Nayuki
I'm going to the hospital

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:50.100
Nayuki
I'm going to the hospital

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:55.980
The season... is spring...

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:56.250
<b>Where the Wind Arrives At</b>
The season... is spring...

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:59.280
<b>Where the Wind Arrives At</b>

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:06.260
Hmm... let's see...

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:06.710
Yuuichi-san!
Hmm... let's see...

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:07.380
Yuuichi-san!

00:03:08.380 --> 00:03:09.970
Sayuri-san!

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:13.350
Congratulations on your graduation!

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:15.470
Thank you very much.

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:17.390
That really looks great on you.

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:20.190
That makes me kinda embarrassed.

00:03:20.310 --> 00:03:25.690
The impression of an elegant and quiet lady is showing all over your body!

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:29.320
I was just thinking, it's so different from a certain violent someone.

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:33.240
What is it?

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:34.660
I guess clothes do make the woman!

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:38.250
That's mean, Yuuichi-san!

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.660
Don't you have anything else to say?

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:43.830
Um... congratulations on your graduation.

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:48.670
Thank you...

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:52.090
Mai's embarrassed!

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:53.800
Ouch!

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:55.640
Ouch! It's going to cave in!

00:03:57.470 --> 00:03:58.520
Studying abroad?

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:01.190
Yes! We decided together!

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:07.520
The colleges abroad are hard to graduate from, but easy to enter.

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:11.400
Um, even if you say it's easy...

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:14.780
It's alright! If I'm with Mai.

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:15.870
Right?

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:20.290
Then it's farewell, I guess.

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:22.670
But, it doesn't mean we can't see each other again.

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:24.790
Yeah, you're right.

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:26.250
Well, goodbye.

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:29.090
Yeah.

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:34.050
Oh my, Aizawa-kun, you know a thing or two about being a playboy.

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:36.430
Kaori!

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:38.060
Yuuichi-san!

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:41.600
Shiori, are you alright? About your health.

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:43.730
Yes, thanks to you.

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:46.110
I didn't do anything.

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:48.940
Nope, it's because of Yuuichi-san's support.

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:52.360
Of course, Onee-chan too.

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:55.780
What's with that way of saying things as if I'm an extra?

00:04:58.450 --> 00:04:59.490
You look well.

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:05.370
Yes! I'm able to attend school like everyone else this spring!

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:10.170
Though I'll have to start again from first year since I didn't attend class enough days.

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:12.050
It's alright.

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:17.140
With your height, it won't make much difference if you're said to be a first year.

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:21.270
I hate people who say something like that.

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:24.350
Um...

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:25.350
What is it?

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:28.690
Will you make a snowman with me sometime?

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:30.690
Huh? Snowman?

00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:35.070
Yes! A super gigantic 40 meter one to celebrate my recovery.

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:37.490
One about 40 meters?

00:05:37.610 --> 00:05:38.320
Yes.

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:40.030
Don't encourage it!

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:42.080
It was a dream that I had since I was little.

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:45.080
Since I can't make one that big by myself.

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.290
40 meters is impossible.

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:49.960
Besides, there's no snow left.

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:51.710
I'll wait until next winter.

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:53.510
Will you make one with me?

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:55.510
Yeah, maybe...

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:57.010
Is something wrong?

00:05:58.010 --> 00:05:59.930
Um, to tell the truth...

00:06:02.850 --> 00:06:03.930
I'm home.

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:05.890
Welcome home...

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:14.610
Piro! When did you come back?

00:06:14.860 --> 00:06:19.070
When I came back from the hospital, he was waiting in front of the door.

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:21.780
Where have you been this whole time?

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:24.290
Gosh, you made us worry.

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:28.170
But... I'm glad...

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:33.300
It will make me less lonely once Yuuichi leaves again.

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:36.260
Transfer?

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:39.180
Akiko-san got in an accident, right?

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:42.680
As a result, my mom got worried...

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:45.430
They're saying things like "Just as we thought, let's live together" to me.

00:06:45.850 --> 00:06:48.600
The place I'll be moving to has already been decided on.

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:50.690
I see.

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:52.690
Does Nayuki know about it?

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:54.400
About Aizawa-kun moving?

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:56.030
Didn't she say something about it?

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:57.190
Not at all.

00:06:57.280 --> 00:06:57.950
I see...

00:06:57.990 --> 00:07:01.660
I thought I would finally get to attend the same school as Yuuichi-san...

00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:03.410
Don't make a face like that.

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:05.950
When there's a break, I'll visit again.

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:07.960
It sure will be lonely...

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:12.920
Huh? Scissors...

00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:16.130
Th... thanks...

00:07:17.590 --> 00:07:19.760
It seems that most of the things have already been cleaned up, I guess...

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:22.550
I've already shipped everything that I have to.

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:23.800
I see...

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:25.390
I've already got the tickets.

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:27.640
It's the special express at three o'clock the day after tomorrow.

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:29.940
Oh... I see...

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:34.980
It seems that there are many procedures for a transfer...

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:37.820
It's a bit annoying, but before the spring break ends...

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:38.780
I'm sorry!

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:43.410
I'll go to the hospital, so go ahead and eat dinner.

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:45.080
Yeah...

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:54.790
Yuuichi said... he'll go home the day after tomorrow.

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:57.250
He said that he already got the tickets.

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:58.260
I see.

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:01.430
Are you okay with that, Nayuki?

00:08:01.590 --> 00:08:02.800
I'm fine.

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:07.310
I can wake up by myself even if Yuuichi doesn't wake me up.

00:08:07.890 --> 00:08:09.470
That's not what I meant.

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:14.350
It was a lot of trouble when you were a child.

00:08:14.980 --> 00:08:19.030
Nayuki, you were crying out loud telling Yuuichi-san, "I don't want you to go home!"

00:08:20.990 --> 00:08:23.200
Whao! When was that story from?

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:25.410
Maybe when you were four or five years old, I think...

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:30.120
Back then, Yuuichi-san visited whenever he had a break.

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:32.580
But Nayuki, you were always crying.

00:08:32.870 --> 00:08:35.460
Was... I... really...?

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:37.290
Yes, you were.

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:03.610
Why don't you be honest?

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:09.080
Don't force yourself and just let all your feelings out.

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:13.620
If it is Yuuichi-san, you don't have any reason to be embarrassed, right?

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:28.970
Good morning, Yuuichi-kun!

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:30.640
Ayu...

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:32.770
Why are you here...?

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:34.430
Ughuuu.

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:36.100
Is it bad for me to be here?

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:38.520
No... I don't think so... but...

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:40.230
What are you doing?

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:43.400
I'm about to make cookies!

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:44.400
Cookies?

00:09:44.820 --> 00:09:47.320
Yeah! I was thinking of giving them to you!

00:09:47.490 --> 00:09:50.450
Don't. It'll just end up black again.

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:52.950
Ughuu. No, it won't.

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:56.330
I've learned how to properly make them from Akiko-san.

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:59.460
How would you improve just because you learned a bit more?

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:01.550
I made the gruel perfectly!

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:04.970
Akiko-san said it was delicious and ate it all!

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:07.720
Of course, she was trying to be nice.

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:12.560
Well, if it looks delicious, then I'll eat it for you.

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:14.220
Really?

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:15.230
Yeah.

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:18.400
That's great! I'll do my best!

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:30.070
Oh man! I've completely overslept!

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:31.910
Yes?

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:33.870
Hey.

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:37.290
Kitagawa... Kaori and Shiori too!

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:39.830
I called them.

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:45.630
Today is Yuuichi's farewell party.

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:56.350
AIZAWAAAA!!!

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:59.900
Why didn't you tell me about moving earlier!?

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:03.150
We finally become friends, and it will make me lonely!

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:05.940
Sorry Kitagawa, I forgot to tell you.

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:07.320
WHAAAT!?

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:12.030
This tastes good!

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:13.530
It's handmade by Shiori.

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:14.830
Oh...?

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:17.120
There's one more thing that's handmade, right?

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:19.580
Um... this is...

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:22.290
Come on, just give it to him.

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:23.460
But...

00:11:23.670 --> 00:11:24.500
Come on.

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:27.130
Um...!

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:28.720
For me?

00:11:29.510 --> 00:11:30.300
Yes!

00:11:30.970 --> 00:11:33.010
Whoa! A hand-knitted muffler!

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:37.890
The cherry-blossoms are already blooming... it's already out of season, right?

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:43.770
Thanks. I'll take very good care of it.

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:46.360
I'm happy...

00:11:46.980 --> 00:11:51.240
I'm so happy... but my tears won't stop...

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:52.280
You're an idiot...

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:55.910
Misaka, I also want one too, a hand knitted muffler.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:57.370
Go knit it by yourself...

00:11:58.290 --> 00:11:59.580
You're so cold!

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:02.040
I'll go make some coffee.

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:03.830
Oh, then I'll...

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:06.460
It's alright. The gust of honor just sits there.

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:11.050
Nayuki...

00:12:12.550 --> 00:12:13.800
See you, Aizawa.

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:15.600
We can meet again, right?

00:12:16.220 --> 00:12:18.060
Thanks Kaori, Shiori.

00:12:18.350 --> 00:12:19.310
What about me?

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:20.600
You too, Kitagawa.

00:12:20.640 --> 00:12:22.890
Whoa... I don't hear it whole-heartedly...

00:12:23.230 --> 00:12:23.900
See you!

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:24.810
Take care of yourself.

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:27.440
Now... we'll have to clean up...

00:12:28.190 --> 00:12:29.070
Nayuki.

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:30.360
What is it?

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:36.450
"Because Ayu-chan was the only thing in Yuuichi's eyes the entire time!"

00:12:37.530 --> 00:12:38.660
What's wrong?

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:40.790
Oh, um, nothing.

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:41.960
You're weird.

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:45.880
Oh... oh yeah, Yuuichi.

00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:50.510
I'll clean up the room, so can you go ahead to the hospital?

00:12:50.880 --> 00:12:52.800
Mom's probably waiting.

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:54.510
Yeah...

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:56.640
Nayuki's avoiding me...

00:12:57.180 --> 00:12:59.640
No... maybe I'm the one who's avoiding her...

00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:04.310
I can't believe how heavy the atmosphere between the two of us is...

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:09.520
After all, did I end up hurting Nayuki?

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:11.900
What is it?

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:15.360
I have to apologize.

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:19.580
In the past, I destroyed the snow bunny that Nayuki gave me...

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:22.370
And I trampled on her feelings...

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:27.540
Nayuki is still just a kid even if a lot of time has passed.

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:34.090
She's the type who still believes that a prince on a white horse will come for her.

00:13:34.170 --> 00:13:35.970
Sh... she is!?

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:40.140
Yuuichi-san, love exists to bolster people.

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:47.270
Even if that love doesn't bear fruit, maybe it will be nourishment for living.

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:04.870
"Even if that love doesn't bear fruit, maybe it will be nourishment for living."

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:11.250
"Nourishment... for living..." ...huh...?

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:26.980
Nayuki?

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:29.650
You're leaving already?

00:14:29.980 --> 00:14:33.980
No... not yet, but you're not sending me off?

00:14:34.480 --> 00:14:37.950
Sorry... Today, mom has an evaluation check-up so...

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:41.620
I see... Tell Akiko-san to take care.

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:43.450
Yeah... See you.

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:48.790
It's almost time.

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:50.000
Yeah...

00:14:52.130 --> 00:14:53.420
You don't need to go?

00:14:53.670 --> 00:14:55.090
To send Yuuichi-san off?

00:14:55.630 --> 00:14:56.630
Yeah...

00:14:57.090 --> 00:14:59.220
It's okay... This is...

00:15:00.890 --> 00:15:03.720
Okay, I gotta get going.

00:15:07.430 --> 00:15:09.600
That reminds me... this alarm clock...

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:12.480
I couldn't give it back to Nayuki properly...

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:20.740
What is it? You want food?

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:22.620
Yuuichi.

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:25.990
Yuuichi, I'm sorry.

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:29.040
I want you to listen without being mad.

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:33.500
Even now, there is so much I like about Yuuichi.

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:36.050
Since even before seven years ago, for a long, long time...

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:39.800
But I'm okay now.

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:43.720
Even if Yuuichi's gone, I'll be totally okay.

00:15:56.440 --> 00:15:57.650
I'm sorry.

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:00.610
No, no need to worry about it.

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:09.190
Tsukimiya Ayu-sama

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:19.050
Yuuichi!

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:24.720
Nayuki...?

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:28.430
Yuuichi, go to the hospital immediately!

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:31.310
What are you talking about? The train is already...

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:36.270
There's someone waiting for Yuuichi. From seven years ago, for the entire time...

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:39.440
It can't be...

00:16:40.780 --> 00:16:41.820
But...

00:16:44.110 --> 00:16:47.740
But... then Nayuki, you...

00:16:58.710 --> 00:16:59.710
Na...

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:01.550
I'm sorry...

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:04.430
But this is the first and last time...

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:05.890
Nayuki...

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:09.140
Please... go immediately to her...

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:26.820
It'll be fine... Yuuichi...

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:29.370
I like the flowing seasons...

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:31.330
I will not say "thank you", I'll tuck it away forever
